        <dt>Unique ID</dt><dd>D017063</dd>

        <dt>RDF Unique Identifier</dt>
        <dd><a href="https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D017063.html">
            http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D017063
        </a></dd>

        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>note category: for admin aspects of patient assessment; outcome only: for outcome assessment with process assessment, <a href="/record/ui?ui=D010043" class="textLink_OUTCOMEANDPROCESSASSESSMENTHEALTHCARE">OUTCOME AND PROCESS ASSESSMENT (HEALTH CARE</a>) and <a href="/record/ui?ui=D016896" class="textLink_TREATMENTOUTCOME">TREATMENT OUTCOME</a> are available</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Research aimed at assessing the quality and effectiveness of health care as measured by the attainment of a specified end result or outcome. Measures include parameters such as improved health, lowered morbidity or mortality, and improvement of abnormal states (such as elevated blood pressure).</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Assessment, Outcome
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Assessment, Outcomes
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcome Assessment
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcome Assessment (Health Care)
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcome Measures
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcome Studies
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcomes Assessment
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Outcomes Research
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>Previous Indexing</dt>
                
                    <dd>Outcome and Process Assessment (Health Care) (1979-1991)</dd>
                
            <dt>Public MeSH Note</dt><dd>2020; was OUTCOME ASSESSMENT (HEALTH CARE) 1992-2019; for PATIENT OUTCOME ASSESSMENT see OUTCOME AND PROCESS ASSESSMENT (HEALTH CARE) 1979-1991</dd>
        
            <dt>History Note</dt><dd>2020 (1992); was OUTCOME ASSESSMENT (HEALTH CARE) 1992-2019; for PATIENT OUTCOME ASSESSMENT use OUTCOME AND PROCESS ASSESSMENT (HEALTH CARE) 1979-1991</dd>
        
        


        
                <dt>Date Introduced</dt>
                <dd>1992/01/01</dd>
            
                <dt>Last Updated</dt>
                <dd>2021/06/30</dd>
            

    </dl>

